<title>USA: Premisys names Williams president, COO.</title>
<headline>Premisys names Williams president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premisys Communications said it named Nicholas Williams president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>As president, he replaces Raymond Lin, who continues to serve as chairman and chief executive officer. The job of chief operating officer is a newly created position.</p>
<p>Williams most recently served as vice president and general manager, international at Tellabs Inc.</p>
